ext":"stay up","rects":[{"x":47.8934,"y":23.1097,"w":6.753,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈsteɪ ˌʌp/","meaning":"熬夜","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s018.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s019","speaker":"narrator","text":"beef","rects":[{"x":62.2031,"y":23.1097,"w":3.9668,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈbiːf/","meaning":"牛肉","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s019.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s020","speaker":"narrator","text":"diet","rects":[{"x":73.7267,"y":23.1097,"w":3.631,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈdaɪət/","meaning":"饮食","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s020.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s021","speaker":"narrator","text":"salt","rects":[{"x":84.9144,"y":23.1097,"w":3.243,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈsɒlt/","meaning":"盐","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s021.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s022","speaker":"narrator","text":"Don’t too late!","rects":[{"x":43.7141,"y":28.0796,"w":30.7915,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˈdəʊnt ˈtuː ˈleɪt!/","meaning":"别太晚！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s022.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s003","speaker":"narrator","text":"Do you want to be healthyg","rects":[{"x":16.3562,"y":28.1529,"w":26.7655,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈduː juː ˈwɒnt tə biː ˈhelθiːg/","meaning":"你想保持健康吗？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s003.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s023","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is","rects":[{"x":75.098,"y":28.1536,"w":3.5565,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz/","meaning":"就是这样","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s023.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s024","speaker":"narrator","text":"to get enough sleep.","rects":[{"x":33.1657,"y":30.1429,"w":19.3553,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/tə get ɪˈnʌf ˈsliːp./","meaning":"以获得足够的睡眠。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s024.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s025","speaker":"narrator","text":"Vegetables, such as and peppers, are good for us.","rects":[{"x":16.3555,"y":32.8102,"w":63.325,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˈvedʒɪtəbəlz, ˈsʌtʃ æz ænd ˈpepəz, ɑː ˈgʊd fɔː ˌʌs./","meaning":"蔬菜，如胡椒，对我们有好处。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s025.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"I eat vegetables at most meals!","rects":[{"x":80.2729,"y":32.8842,"w":4.1489,"h":1.7375},{"x":16.3572,"y":34.874,"w":24.3154,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈiːt ˈvedʒɪtəbəlz æt ˈməʊst ˈmiːlz!/","meaning":"我吃蔬菜最多吃一顿！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s004.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s026","speaker":"narrator","text":"Foods with lots of can be unhealthy.","rects":[{"x":16.3572,"y":37.5408,"w":51.8156,"h":1.8119}],"ipa":"/ˈfuːdz wɪð ˈlɒts ɒv kæn biː ʌˈnhelθiː./","meaning":"大量食物可能会不健康。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s026.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s027","speaker":"narrator","text":"I try to keep these","rects":[{"x":68.7653,"y":37.6147,"w":17.2456,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈtraɪ tə ˈkiːp ˈðiːz/","meaning":"我试着留着这些","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s027.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s028","speaker":"narrator","text":"foods out of my.","rects":[{"x":16.3573,"y":39.5301,"w":32.7102,"h":1.812}],"ipa":"/ˈfuːdz ˈaʊt ɒv ˈmaɪ./","meaning":"食物从我这里出来。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s028.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"White meat like chicken is also good for our health.","rects":[{"x":16.3573,"y":42.3453,"w":49.8673,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈwaɪt ˈmiːt ˈlaɪk ˈtʃɪkɪn ɪz ˈɔːlsəʊ ˈgʊd fɔː ˌaʊə ˈhelθ./","meaning":"像鸡一样的白肉也对我们的健康有好处。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s005.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s029","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is fine to eat some","rects":[{"x":66.817,"y":42.3453,"w":19.5205,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz ˈfaɪn tʊ ˈiːt ˌsʌm/","meaning":"吃点就好","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s029.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s030","speaker":"narrator","text":"but I don’t eat a lot of it.","rects":[{"x":33.7582,"y":44.3347,"w":23.6776,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌbʌt ˌaɪ ˈdəʊnt ˈiːt ə ˈlɒt ɒv ɪt./","meaning":"但我没有吃太多。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s030.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"Help her complete the sentences with a, an or the correct forms of the nouns in brackets.","rects":[{"x":80.6536,"y":49.793,"w":7.3937,"h":2.0721},{"x":13.6009,"y":51.7616,"w":69.6253,"h":2.1405}],"ipa":"/ˈhelp hɜː kəˈmpliːt ðə ˈsentənsɪz wɪð ə, ən ɔː ðə kəˈrekt ˈfɔːmz ɒv ðə ˈnaʊnz ɪn ˈbrækɪts./","meaning":"帮助她用括号中的名词的a，a或正确形式完成句子。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s008.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"A2 Nora is reading a leaflet from the Get Fit Club.","rects":[{"x":14.181,"y":49.793,"w":43.8663,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ ˈtuː ˈnɔːrə ɪz ˈriːdɪŋ ə ˈliːflɪt frɒm ðə ˌget ˈfɪt ˈklʌb./","meaning":"A2 Nora正在读Get Fit俱乐部的传单。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s006.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"Some words are missing.","rects":[{"x":58.5022,"y":49.793,"w":21.6965,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˌsʌm ˈwɜːdz ɑː ˈmɪsɪŋ./","meaning":"少了些话","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s007.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"Here are some tips for you to get fit!","rects":[{"x":19.2819,"y":56.905,"w":34.5968,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈhɪə ɑː ˌsʌm ˈtɪps fɔː juː tə get ˈfɪt!/","meaning":"给你一些小费，让你适应！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s009.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s031","speaker":"narrator","text":"Eat","rects":[{"x":21.6028,"y":59.3254,"w":3.6768,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˈiːt/","meaning":"吃饭","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s031.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s041","speaker":"narrator","text":"apple or some","rects":[{"x":42.0067,"y":59.3256,"w":14.1316,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˈæpəl ɔː ˌsʌm/","meaning":"苹果还是一些","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s041.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s042","speaker":"narrator","text":"(orange) every","rects":[{"x":72.8643,"y":59.3256,"w":14.4371,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/(ˈɒrɪndʒ) ˈevəriː/","meaning":"(橙色) 每一个","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s042.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"day.","rects":[{"x":21.9415,"y":61.4481,"w":3.8847,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈdeɪ./","meaning":"日报。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s010.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s043","speaker":"narrator","text":"glass of milk every day and lots of","rects":[{"x":44.5579,"y":63.8682,"w":33.2741,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˈglɑːs ɒv ˈmɪlk ˈevəriː ˈdeɪ ænd ˈlɒts ɒv/","meaning":"每天喝杯牛奶 喝很多","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s043.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s032","speaker":"narrator","text":"Drink","rects":[{"x":21.6037,"y":63.8685,"w":6.228,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˈdrɪŋk/","meaning":"来，喝吧","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s032.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s033","speaker":"narrator","text":"(water) as well.","rects":[{"x":38.7509,"y":65.9902,"w":14.3354,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/(ˈwɔːtə) æz ˈwel./","meaning":"(水)也一样。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s033.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s034","speaker":"narrator","text":"For breakfast, you can have","rects":[{"x":21.6029,"y":68.4106,"w":26.9354,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˌfɔː ˈbrekfəst, juː kæn ˈhæv/","meaning":"早餐的时候，你可以吃","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s034.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s044","speaker":"narrator","text":"egg,","rects":[{"x":65.2648,"y":68.4108,"w":4.5066,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˈeg,/","meaning":"鸡蛋","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s044.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"glass of juice and some bread.","rects":[{"x":21.9411,"y":70.5333,"w":28.5634,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈglɑːs ɒv ˈdʒuːs ænd ˌsʌm ˈbred./","meaning":"一杯果汁和一些面包。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s011.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s035","speaker":"narrator","text":"For lunch, don’t just eat sandwich or a hamburger.","rects":[{"x":21.9411,"y":73.085,"w":65.5248,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˌfɔː ˈlʌntʃ, ˈdəʊnt ˈdʒʌst ˈiːt ˈsændwɪtʃ ɔː ə ˈhæˌmbɜːgə./","meaning":"午餐时不要吃三明治或汉堡。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s035.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s036","speaker":"narrator","text":"Have some (vegetable) too.","rects":[{"x":21.9422,"y":75.0014,"w":42.7319,"h":1.812}],"ipa":"/ˌhæv ˌsʌm (ˈvedʒɪtəbəl) ˈtuː./","meaning":"也吃点(蔬菜)。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s036.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s037","speaker":"narrator","text":"For dinner, you can eat","rects":[{"x":21.6027,"y":77.4958,"w":22.9204,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˌfɔː ˈdɪnə, juː kæn ˈiːt/","meaning":"吃晚饭吧，吃吧","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s037.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s045","speaker":"narrator","text":"bowl of rice with","rects":[{"x":61.2502,"y":77.496,"w":16.9656,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˈbəʊl ɒv ˈraɪs wɪð/","meaning":"碗饭加","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s045.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"vegetables and chicken.","rects":[{"x":21.9423,"y":79.6185,"w":22.7797,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈvedʒɪtəbəlz ænd ˈtʃɪkɪn./","meaning":"蔬菜和鸡肉。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s012.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s038","speaker":"narrator","text":"Don’t eat things with too much (salt) in them.","rects":[{"x":21.9423,"y":82.1702,"w":62.4022,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˈdəʊnt ˈiːt ˈθɪŋz wɪð ˈtuː ˈmʌtʃ (ˈsɒlt) ɪn ˌðem./","meaning":"不要吃太多(盐)的东西。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s038.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s039","speaker":"narrator","text":"Also, don’t eat too many sweet (snack).","rects":[{"x":21.9418,"y":84.0866,"w":55.3001,"h":1.812}],"ipa":"/ˈɔːlsəʊ, ˈdəʊnt ˈiːt ˈtuː ˈmeniː ˈswiːt (ˈsnæk)./","meaning":"另外，不要吃太多甜食（snack）。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s039.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s040","speaker":"narrator","text":"Exercise for 30 minutes every day and get enough","rects":[{"x":21.9398,"y":86.7128,"w":65.4552,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˈeksəsaɪz fɔː ˈθɜːtiː ˈmɪnɪts ˈevəriː ˈdeɪ ænd get ɪˈnʌf/","meaning":"每天锻炼30分钟，够用","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s040.wav"},{"id":"u15-p118-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"(sleep) every night.","rects":[{"x":21.9415,"y":88.7037,"w":18.3953,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/(ˈsliːp) ˈevəriː ˈnaɪt./","meaning":"(睡觉)每晚。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p118-s013.wav"}]},{"page":119,"pdfPage":120,"width":532.9130249023438,"height":754.0159912109375,"image":"assets/pages/page-119.webp","sentences":[{"id":"u15-p119-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"Unit 5","rects":[{"x":84.4168,"y":3.6233,"w":6.0077,"h":1.8477}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːnɪt ˈfaɪv/","meaning":"第5单元","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s010.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"B Healthy and tasty","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":6.4851,"w":29.6001,"h":2.6041}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː ˈhelθiː ænd ˈteɪstiː/","meaning":"B 健康又美味 不错","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s011.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s002","speaker":"narrator","text":"Listen to their conversations and complete the notes below.","rects":[{"x":72.1325,"y":10.2356,"w":11.9195,"h":2.0721},{"x":12.0052,"y":12.225,"w":39.3453,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈlɪsən tə ðeə ˌkɒnvəˈseɪʃənz ænd kəˈmpliːt ðə ˈnəʊts bɪˈləʊ./","meaning":"听他们的谈话，并完成下面的笔记。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s002.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s001","speaker":"narrator","text":"B1 David is talking to his aunt and uncle about what food they like.","rects":[{"x":12.7704,"y":10.2356,"w":58.9072,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː ˈwʌn ˈdeɪvɪd ɪz ˈtɔːkɪŋ tə hɪz ˈɑːnt ænd ˈʌŋkəl əˈbaʊt ˌwɒt ˈfuːd ðeɪ ˈlaɪk./","meaning":"B1大卫正在和他的姑姑和叔叔谈论他们喜欢什么食物。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s001.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"Aunt Su likes.","rects":[{"x":35.1507,"y":19.4895,"w":29.9535,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˈɑːnt ˈlaɪks./","meaning":"苏姨喜欢。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s012.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"They help her","rects":[{"x":65.6967,"y":19.5635,"w":13.421,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌðeɪ ˈhelp ˌhɜː/","meaning":"他们帮她","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s013.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s014","speaker":"narrator","text":"She loves.","rects":[{"x":52.5525,"y":21.8767,"w":26.2794,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˌʃiː ˈlʌvz./","meaning":"她爱她。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s014.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s015","speaker":"narrator","text":"She","rects":[{"x":79.4243,"y":21.9507,"w":3.412,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌʃiː/","meaning":"她","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s015.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"eats fruit like","rects":[{"x":34.8131,"y":24.2048,"w":13.1511,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˈiːts ˈfruːt ˈlaɪk/","meaning":"吃水果一样","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s016.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s023","speaker":"narrator","text":"as a snack when she","rects":[{"x":64.6803,"y":24.2053,"w":19.9731,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/æz ə ˈsnæk ˌwen ʃiː/","meaning":"当她做点心的时候","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s023.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s003","speaker":"narrator","text":"is hungry.","rects":[{"x":35.1522,"y":26.7246,"w":9.565,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ɪz ˈhʌŋgriː./","meaning":"饿了。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s003.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"Uncle Lin has","rects":[{"x":34.8144,"y":40.6028,"w":13.921,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ˈʌŋkəl ˈhæz/","meaning":"林叔有过","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s017.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s024","speaker":"narrator","text":"and milk for","rects":[{"x":65.46,"y":40.6028,"w":12.6186,"h":2.0027}],"ipa":"/ænd ˈmɪlk fɔː/","meaning":"和牛奶，用于","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s024.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s018","speaker":"narrator","text":"He thinks this is.","rects":[{"x":44.9232,"y":43.0487,"w":33.0238,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˌhiː ˈθɪŋks ðɪs ɪz./","meaning":"他认为这是。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s018.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"breakfast.","rects":[{"x":35.1517,"y":43.1222,"w":9.1792,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈbrekfəst./","meaning":"早饭","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s004.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s019","speaker":"narrator","text":"He has meat or for lunch.","rects":[{"x":35.1515,"y":45.4359,"w":41.4355,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˌhiː hæz ˈmiːt ɔː fɔː ˈlʌntʃ./","meaning":"他有肉或午餐。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s019.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s020","speaker":"narrator","text":"He","rects":[{"x":77.1794,"y":45.5099,"w":2.6669,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌhiː/","meaning":"他","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s020.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s021","speaker":"narrator","text":"sometimes eats meat.","rects":[{"x":35.1517,"y":47.8232,"w":37.8975,"h":1.8115}],"ipa":"/ˈsʌmtaɪmz ˈiːts ˈmiːt./","meaning":"有时吃肉。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s021.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"B2 Do you like sweet foodsg","rects":[{"x":12.6205,"y":58.5775,"w":25.1058,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː ˈtuː ˈduː juː ˈlaɪk ˈswiːt ˈfuːdzg/","meaning":"B2你喜欢甜食吗？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s005.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"Why or why notg","rects":[{"x":38.1812,"y":58.5775,"w":14.8133,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˌwaɪ ɔː ˌwaɪ ˌnɒtg/","meaning":"为什么或为什么不？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s006.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"Work in pairs and talk about sweet foods.","rects":[{"x":53.4493,"y":58.5775,"w":36.4877,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈwɜːk ɪn ˈpeəz ænd ˈtɔːk əˈbaʊt ˈswiːt ˈfuːdz./","meaning":"成对工作，谈甜食。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s007.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"Use the example below to help you.","rects":[{"x":12.0052,"y":60.5669,"w":31.0945,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːz ðiː ɪˈgzɑːmpəl bɪˈləʊ tə ˈhelp juː./","meaning":"用下面的例子来帮助你。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s008.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"Do you like sweet foodsg","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":64.3173,"w":24.7504,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈduː juː ˈlaɪk ˈswiːt ˈfuːdzg/","meaning":"你喜欢甜食吗？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s009.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s022","speaker":"narrator","text":"A:","rects":[{"x":12.0071,"y":64.5367,"w":1.9692,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ:/","meaning":"答复:","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s022.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s038","speaker":"narrator","text":"Of course!","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":67.4568,"w":10.7184,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌɒv ˈkɔːs!/","meaning":"当然！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s038.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s026","speaker":"narrator","text":"I love sweet foods!","rects":[{"x":25.578,"y":67.4568,"w":18.653,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈlʌv ˈswiːt ˈfuːdz!/","meaning":"我喜欢甜食！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s026.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s025","speaker":"b","text":"B:","rects":[{"x":11.5192,"y":67.4772,"w":2.8603,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː:/","meaning":"B类:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s025.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s039","speaker":"narrator","text":"Why do you like themg","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":70.5962,"w":23.6213,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌwaɪ ˈduː juː ˈlaɪk ˌðemg/","meaning":"你为什么喜欢他们？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s039.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s027","speaker":"a","text":"A:","rects":[{"x":11.5192,"y":70.6166,"w":2.9449,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ:/","meaning":"答复:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s027.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s040","speaker":"narrator","text":"They’re delicious and can make me happy.","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":73.7357,"w":41.926,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌðeə dɪˈlɪʃəs ænd kæn ˌmeɪk ˌmiː ˈhæpiː./","meaning":"它们很美味，也能让我开心。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s040.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s028","speaker":"b","text":"B:","rects":[{"x":11.5192,"y":73.7561,"w":2.8603,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː:/","meaning":"B类:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s028.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s029","speaker":"narrator","text":"I can never say no to them.","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":76.1224,"w":27.2996,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ kæn ˈnevə ˈseɪ ˈnəʊ tə ˌðem./","meaning":"我永远不能拒绝他们。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s029.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s030","speaker":"narrator","text":"What about youg","rects":[{"x":42.1591,"y":76.1224,"w":17.6085,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌwɒt əˈbaʊt juːg/","meaning":"你呢？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s030.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s031","speaker":"narrator","text":"Do you have a sweet toothg","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":78.509,"w":27.6175,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈduː juː hæv ə ˈswiːt ˈtuːθg/","meaning":"你有甜牙吗？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s031.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s041","speaker":"narrator","text":"No, I don’t.","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":81.6485,"w":12.0581,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈnəʊ, ˌaɪ ˈdəʊnt./","meaning":"不，我没有。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s041.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s033","speaker":"narrator","text":"I’m not a big fan of sweet foods.","rects":[{"x":26.9176,"y":81.6485,"w":31.915,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪm ˌnɒt ə ˈbɪg ˈfæn ɒv ˈswiːt ˈfuːdz./","meaning":"我并不爱吃甜食。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s033.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s032","speaker":"a","text":"A:","rects":[{"x":11.5192,"y":81.6689,"w":2.9449,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ:/","meaning":"答复:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s032.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s042","speaker":"narrator","text":"Reallyg","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":84.788,"w":7.7337,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈrɪəliːg/","meaning":"真的吗？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s042.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s035","speaker":"narrator","text":"Why notg","rects":[{"x":22.5933,"y":84.788,"w":10.5533,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌwaɪ ˌnɒtg/","meaning":"为什么不呢？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s035.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s034","speaker":"b","text":"B:","rects":[{"x":11.5192,"y":84.8084,"w":2.8603,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː:/","meaning":"B类:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s034.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s043","speaker":"narrator","text":"Well, too many sweets are bad for my teeth and my health.","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":87.9274,"w":57.9333,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈwel, ˈtuː ˈmeniː ˈswiːts ɑː ˈbæd fɔː maɪ ˈtiːθ ænd maɪ ˈhelθ./","meaning":"太多的甜品会伤到我的牙齿和身体","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s043.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s037","speaker":"narrator","text":"I don’t like to eat these foods too often.","rects":[{"x":15.2429,"y":87.9274,"w":75.0036,"h":4.5221}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈdəʊnt ˈlaɪk tʊ ˈiːt ðiːz ˈfuːdz ˈtuː ˈɒfən./","meaning":"我不太喜欢吃这些食物。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s037.wav"},{"id":"u15-p119-s036","speaker":"a","text":"A:","rects":[{"x":11.5192,"y":87.9478,"w":2.9449,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ:/","meaning":"答复:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p119-s036.wav"}]},{"page":120,"pdfPage":121,"width":532.9130249023438,"height":754.0159912109375,"image":"assets/pages/page-120.webp","sentences":[{"id":"u15-p120-s021","speaker":"narrator","text":"Unit 5","rects":[{"x":9.5745,"y":3.6233,"w":6.0077,"h":1.8477}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːnɪt ˈfaɪv/","meaning":"第5单元","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s021.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s022","speaker":"narrator","text":"C A better lifestyle","rects":[{"x":13.6011,"y":6.4851,"w":28.5347,"h":2.6041}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ə ˈbetə ˈlaɪfstaɪl/","meaning":"C 更好的生活方式","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s022.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s002","speaker":"narrator","text":"Read the article with him and complete the chart below.","rects":[{"x":62.0614,"y":10.2356,"w":25.8281,"h":2.0721},{"x":13.6009,"y":12.225,"w":22.8773,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈriːd ðiː ˈɑːtɪkəl wɪð ˌhɪm ænd kəˈmpliːt ðə ˈtʃɑːt bɪˈləʊ./","meaning":"与他一起阅读文章，并填写下图。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s002.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s001","speaker":"narrator","text":"C1 David found an article on the Get Fit Club website.","rects":[{"x":14.3627,"y":10.2356,"w":47.2438,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈwʌn ˈdeɪvɪd ˈfaʊnd ən ˈɑːtɪkəl ˌɒn ðə ˌget ˈfɪt ˈklʌb ˈwebsaɪt./","meaning":"C1 David在Get Fit Club网站上发现了一篇文章。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s001.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s003","speaker":"narrator","text":"How to live to 100g","rects":[{"x":40.2049,"y":19.3488,"w":25.1227,"h":2.2188}],"ipa":"/ˌhaʊ tə ˈlɪv tə ˈwʌn ˈhʌndrədg/","meaning":"如何活到100岁？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s003.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"Do you want to live to 100g","rects":[{"x":18.4309,"y":22.141,"w":26.7759,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈduː juː ˈwɒnt tə ˈlɪv tə ˈwʌn ˈhʌndrədg/","meaning":"你想活到100岁吗？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s004.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"Here are some helpful tips.","rects":[{"x":45.7991,"y":22.141,"w":25.7355,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈhɪə ɑː ˌsʌm ˈhelpfʊl ˈtɪps./","meaning":"这里有一些有用的提示。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s005.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"Start your day with a healthy breakfast.","rects":[{"x":18.4309,"y":24.8821,"w":37.8024,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈstɑːt jɔː ˈdeɪ wɪð ə ˈhelθiː ˈbrekfəst./","meaning":"开始你的一天一个健康的早餐。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s006.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"An egg, milk and bread are great for breakfast.","rects":[{"x":56.8257,"y":24.8821,"w":25.781,"h":1.7375},{"x":18.4309,"y":26.872,"w":17.8361,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ən ˈeg, ˈmɪlk ænd ˈbred ɑː ˈgreɪt fɔː ˈbrekfəst./","meaning":"鸡蛋、牛奶和面包是早餐的好东西","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s007.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"For lunch and dinner, you can have rice, vegetables and some meat.","rects":[{"x":59.4905,"y":26.872,"w":25.2732,"h":1.7375},{"x":18.4309,"y":28.8619,"w":39.4971,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌfɔː ˈlʌntʃ ænd ˈdɪnə, juː kæn hæv ˈraɪs, ˈvedʒɪtəbəlz ænd ˌsʌm ˈmiːt./","meaning":"午餐和晚餐可以吃大米，蔬菜和一些肉类。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s009.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"They make you strong.","rects":[{"x":36.8594,"y":26.872,"w":22.0387,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌðeɪ ˌmeɪk juː ˈstrɒŋ./","meaning":"让你变得坚强","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s008.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"Try to eat healthy snacks like an apple or orange but not sweets.","rects":[{"x":58.5204,"y":28.8619,"w":23.8584,"h":1.7375},{"x":18.4309,"y":30.8518,"w":37.0862,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈtraɪ tʊ ˈiːt ˈhelθiː ˈsnæks ˈlaɪk ən ˈæpəl ɔː ˈɒrɪndʒ ˌbʌt ˌnɒt ˈswiːts./","meaning":"尝试吃健康的小吃，如苹果或橘子，但不吃甜点。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s010.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"Sweets give you energy, but too many of them are bad for your health.","rects":[{"x":56.1094,"y":30.8518,"w":30.1693,"h":1.7375},{"x":18.4309,"y":32.8417,"w":37.0098,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈswiːts ˈgɪv juː ˈenədʒiː, ˌbʌt ˈtuː ˈmeniː ɒv ˌðem ɑː ˈbæd fɔː jɔː ˈhelθ./","meaning":"Sweets给你能量，但太多的它们对你的健康有害。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s011.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"To stay fit, try to exercise for about 30 minutes every day.","rects":[{"x":18.4309,"y":35.5828,"w":55.0623,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/tə ˈsteɪ ˈfɪt, ˈtraɪ tʊ ˈeksəsaɪz fɔː əˈbaʊt ˈθɜːtiː ˈmɪnɪts ˈevəriː ˈdeɪ./","meaning":"为了保持身体健全，尝试每天锻炼约30分钟。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s012.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"You can swim, run or play football.","rects":[{"x":74.0855,"y":35.5828,"w":7.6309,"h":1.7375},{"x":18.4309,"y":37.5727,"w":25.6158,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌjuː kæn ˈswɪm, ˈrʌn ɔː ˈpleɪ ˈfʊtbɔːl./","meaning":"你可以游泳，跑步或踢足球。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s013.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s014","speaker":"narrator","text":"Walking is also good exercise.","rects":[{"x":44.6391,"y":37.5727,"w":28.4371,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈwɔːkɪŋ ɪz ˈɔːlsəʊ ˈgʊd ˈeksəsaɪz./","meaning":"步行也是很好的锻炼。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s014.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s015","speaker":"narrator","text":"So, change your lifestyle today!","rects":[{"x":18.4309,"y":40.3139,"w":30.0124,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌsəʊ, ˈtʃeɪndʒ jɔː ˈlaɪfstaɪl təˈdeɪ!/","meaning":"所以，改变你的生活方式今天！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s015.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"You can feel young and healthy with the right food and exercise.","rects":[{"x":49.0357,"y":40.3139,"w":35.4881,"h":1.7375},{"x":18.4309,"y":42.3038,"w":26.3193,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌjuː kæn ˈfiːl ˈjʌŋ ænd ˈhelθiː wɪð ðə ˈraɪt ˈfuːd ænd ˈeksəsaɪz./","meaning":"用正确的食物和锻炼可以感到年轻和健康。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s016.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s023","speaker":"narrator","text":"breakfast:;","rects":[{"x":62.8342,"y":49.2266,"w":26.1202,"h":1.846}],"ipa":"/ˈbrekfəst:;/","meaning":"早餐:","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s023.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s024","speaker":"narrator","text":"lunch and dinner: rice,","rects":[{"x":62.835,"y":51.3211,"w":21.1573,"h":1.7404}],"ipa":"/ˈlʌntʃ ænd ˈdɪnə: ˈraɪs,/","meaning":"午餐和晚餐:米饭，","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s024.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s025","speaker":"narrator","text":"and some","rects":[{"x":79.6455,"y":53.3099,"w":8.9377,"h":1.7404}],"ipa":"/ænd ˌsʌm/","meaning":"还有一些","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s025.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s026","speaker":"narrator","text":"meat","rects":[{"x":62.8352,"y":55.2998,"w":4.636,"h":1.7404}],"ipa":"/ˈmiːt/","meaning":"肉类","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s026.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s027","speaker":"narrator","text":"Have a healthy diet","rects":[{"x":33.9344,"y":56.5244,"w":17.5492,"h":1.7404}],"ipa":"/ˌhæv ə ˈhelθiː ˈdaɪət/","meaning":"吃个健康的食物","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s027.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s028","speaker":"narrator","text":"like an apple","rects":[{"x":76.9859,"y":60.3218,"w":11.4724,"h":1.7404}],"ipa":"/ˈlaɪk ən ˈæpəl/","meaning":"像苹果一样","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s028.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"How to live to 100g","rects":[{"x":16.2616,"y":62.0973,"w":11.0121,"h":1.7506},{"x":16.2616,"y":64.0872,"w":7.1543,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˌhaʊ tə ˈlɪv tə ˈwʌn ˈhʌndrədg/","meaning":"如何活到100岁？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s017.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s029","speaker":"narrator","text":"or orange","rects":[{"x":60.1757,"y":62.3117,"w":8.9088,"h":1.7404}],"ipa":"/ɔː ˈɒrɪndʒ/","meaning":"或 橙色","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s029.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s030","speaker":"narrator","text":"swim, run, play football or walk","rects":[{"x":60.1757,"y":70.0582,"w":28.9308,"h":1.7404}],"ipa":"/ˈswɪm, ˈrʌn, ˈpleɪ ˈfʊtbɔːl ɔː ˈwɔːk/","meaning":"游泳、跑步、踢足球或走路","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s030.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s031","speaker":"narrator","text":"every day","rects":[{"x":33.9341,"y":70.6763,"w":8.7189,"h":1.7404}],"ipa":"/ˈevəriː ˈdeɪ/","meaning":"日复一日","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u15/u15-p120-s031.wav"},{"id":"u15-p120-s019","speaker":"narrator","text":"What do you plan to do after reading the article aboveg","rects":[{"x":50.5935,"y":78.0903,"w":35.98,"h":2.0721},{"x":13.6009,"y":80.0796,"w":12.2544,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˌwɒt ˈduː juː ˈplæn tə ˈduː ˈɑːftə ˈriːdɪŋ ðiː ˈɑːtɪkəl əˈbʌvg/","meaning":"你读